  ('ca-business-visitors', 'determine_visa_or_eta', 'If you qualify as a business visitor, answer a few questions to find out what you may need to apply for, and which documents you’ll need to come to Canada.'),
  ('ca-business-visitors', 'obtain_event_code', 'If you need a visitor visa to travel to Canada and your meeting, event or conference is registered with Immigration, Refugees and Citizenship Canada (IRCC), your organizer will provide you with an event code and instructions about how to apply for a visa.'),
