  ('ca-business-visitors', 'invitation_letter_notarization', 'Some visa offices may need these letters to be notarized. Contact the Canadian visa office of your visitor’s country to find out if this is required.'),
  ('ca-business-visitors', 'invitation_letter_no_guarantee', 'If you need a visa, a letter of invitation does not guarantee that a visa will be issued. Visa officers assess applicants to find out if they are eligible to visit Canada.'),
