  ('ca-electronic-travel-authorization-eta', 'eta_required_country_air_travel', 'You need an electronic travel authorization (eTA) and a valid passport to board your flight to Canada if you’re a citizen of any of the eTA-required countries or territories. You don’t need a visitor visa.'),
  ('ca-electronic-travel-authorization-eta', 'valid_travel_document', 'To visit Canada, you’ll need to meet some basic requirements, such as: have a valid travel document, such as a passport'),
